WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Time to five minutes

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:08.833
Grandma makes coffee in the afternoon. Let us read the clock together.

3
00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:13.100
The short hand is just past three, so the hour is three.

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.767
The long hand is on the three: five, ten, fifteen minutes.

5
00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:22.233
The time is three fifteen; we also say quarter past three.

6
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:26.467
In Ethiopian time it is quarter past nine.
